      449.73
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 3 & 4 of the Societies Ordinance (Chapter 123), I, Dr. Ramesh Pathirana, Minister of Ministry of Industries do by this notification;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
