      460.59,
      542.5,
      497.73
    ],
    "text": "01. Authorize the purpose for which the Society known as \u201cGREEN VALLEY FARMER SOCIETY\u201d situated Heraliyawala Industrial Park, Malkaduwawa, Kurunegala as a purpose to which the powers and facilities of that Ordinance ought to be extended; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      508.59,
      542.48,
      533.73
    ],
    "text": "02. Limit the application of that Ordinance to aforesaid society by exempting it from the provision of Section 5(4) of that Ordinance.",
